# Dev defaults (see README.md "Environment variables").
# Everything goes to the FastAPI backend in fpa-project, proxied by Vite from
# :8080 to :8000 (see vite.config.js). There is no mock layer: the bearer token
# entered on the sign-in screen is what scopes every request, so a mocked
# response would prove nothing about scope.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/
